  "title": "HYMNS SUITABLE FOR YOUNG WORSHIPERS",
  "note": "Worshipers from preschool through junior high can enjoy learning to sing the great hymns of the church. These hymns then become lifelong companions and make it easier for the children and youth to be involved in the services of the church. The following hymns are recommended for family worship, school, Sabbath school, and choirs. The hymns marked with asterisks are suggested as suitable for young children.",
